# A page shared from its header on a desk, on a local accounts API: the Share dialog, its link, then, its
# tab closed, the page in the tab rail's Shared section.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
signed-in
prefer themeId aura-noir
prefer starAsked true
replies pages.json
project storefront shop
patch pages-notes.diff
chat Wren
title "Cache the product pages"
say "Plan the product page cache and show me the numbers."
settle 10
front Wren
settle 2
key cmd-alt-8
settle 3
click 1223,188
settle 4
click 1007,98
move 900,60
settle 1
snap pages-share-dialog
key enter
hold 3
settle 1
snap pages-share-link
key escape
settle 1
click 1092,63
settle 2
move 913,63
click 913,63
settle 2
snap pages-share-rail
